#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:581
msgid ""
"DSCP codepoints: CS0–CS7, AF11–AF43, EF, VA, NQB, LE, DF. Any dscp_* value "
"may also name a class. Prefix with + to override only when the DSCP field is "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"DSCP codepoints: CS0–CS7, AF11–AF43, EF, VA, NQB, LE, DF. ຄ່າ dscp_* "
"ໃດໆກໍຕາມອາດໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຊື່ຄລາສໄດ້. ໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ + ທາງໜ້າເພື່ອຂຽນທັບສະເພາະເມື່ອຟິລ DSCP ເປັນສູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:734
msgid "DSCP mapping rules loaded by qosify on startup."
msgstr "ກົດເກນການຈັບຄູ່ DSCP ທີ່ qosify ໂຫຼດຂຶ້ນມາຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:583
msgid ""
"Defaults qosify applies when a key is absent — interface: mode diffserv4, "
"ingress 1, egress 1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, autorate_ingress 0. device: "
"identical except nat 0. defaults: timeout 3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, "
"dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/dscp_icmp unset, bulk_trigger_pps/bulk_trigger_timeout/"
"prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0 (disabled)."
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ qosify ນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ — interface: mode diffserv4, ingress 1, "
"egress 1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, autorate_ingress 0. device: ຄືກັນຍົກເວັ້ນ nat 0. "
"defaults: timeout 3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/"
"dscp_icmp ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, bulk_trigger_pps/bulk_trigger_timeout/"
"prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0 (ປິດໃຊ້ງານ)."

